    api POST "/events" -> Mutation rate write since "2026-09-06":
        summary "The mutation lane: one event_type per call, as a form or a JSON object."
        description "See x-mutation-events for every event_type, its fields, and the JSON result a native caller (Accept: application/json) receives. Web callers receive rendered Facet fragments; that projection is not part of this contract."
        operation "postEvent"
